  "review_notes": [
    "ARG scopes live in the POST subscriptions body; query filters are not scope.",
    "Only the fixed id/type projection is accepted; no upstream/arbitrary KQL.",
    "Rows, counts, resultTruncated and skipToken determine page exhaustion, not RBAC completeness; eventual consistency and child gaps remain explicit.",
    "Definitions are listed at exact scopes; references resolve only inside the boundary or as built-ins, without ancestor-scope read escalation.",
    "Definition/rule/parameter hashes and associations are configuration, not compliance. No policy rules or deployment actions are executed.",
    "Pinned PolicyStates 2019-10-01 and exemption 2022-07-01-preview operations remain; management-group exemption lists explicitly use atScope()."
  ]
